  "text": "\r\n\t\t Alert Center • Wolfeboro, NH • CivicEngage \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Visitors   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nAlert Center \r\nTown Clerk Alerts \r\n\t\t\t\t ◄ Back \r\n\t\t\t\t August 10, 2026 8:00 AM \r\nWolfeboro Town Clerk's Office closed on Fridays starting August 14, 2026 \r\nEffective Immediately  \nthe Wolfeboro Town Clerk’s Office  \nwill be closed on Friday’s commencing on  \nAugust 14th, 2026 until further notice. \nPlease plan accordingly. \nPatricia M. Waterman, Town Clerk \n                         Module Search \r\n                     Enter Search Terms \r\n                     Select a Category \r\n\t\t All Categories \r\n\t\t Town Clerk Alerts \r\nTools \r\nRSS \r\nNotify Me \r\nShow Archived \r\nCategories \r\nAll Categories \r\nTown Clerk Alerts \r\nLive Edit \n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Town Calendar \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \nLearn more \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Wolfeboro \r\n84 S Main Street \r\nP.O. Box 629 \r\nWolfeboro, New Hampshire 03894 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Public Notices \n         Hours \n         Property Tax Bills \n         Pay Utility Bills \n         Bids & RFPs \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Website Sign-In \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
